														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2710891">
									

<p>The interview really killed this for me.</p>
<p>For starters, I was expecting something more poignant or somber, given the subject matter, so for it to be lighthearted and casual was jarring. I think I'd have been eased into that if you were to move the rest of the description above the log ('do not seem to find anything unusual about this' in particular would have been handy to know beforehand). Second, there's nothing particularly noteworthy in it. It's for the most part a rundown of of a bland process.</p>
<p>I think it'd be better off without it, the reviews were the real highlight of the article.</p>

							</div>

								
					
