														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4212261">
									

<p>I'm going to agree with everyone who said that the premise or the idea of this SCP is amazing and has a lot of potential, but the issues with tone and execution prevented an upvote from me.</p>
<p>These lines from the interview log gave me anomalous cringe.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>CC</strong>: Me too! I hope it doesn’t get too confusing. [Laughs]<br />
&#8230;<br />
<strong>CC</strong>: Oh, Kat.<br />
&#8230;<br />
<strong>CC</strong>: Wow! I heard they went the extra mile but that’s amazing!</p>
</blockquote>
<p>It seems like the author simply agreed to disagree with all the criticisms and did not do anything to rectify the faults in this article, though, so I expect this will stay in the low +s.</p>

